\'b9i th\'de tr\'ad\'eang khu v\'f9c \'ae\'d3 k\'aa khai - Gi\'b8 nh\'cbp kh\'c8u \'ae\'ad\'eec \'b8p d\'f4ng \'ae\'d3 x\'b8c \'ae\'denh t\'fb l\'d6 n\'e9i \'ae\'dea ho\'b8 trong n\'a8m T\'b5i ch\'ddnh \'ae\'c7u ti\'aan \'ae\'a8ng k\'fd th\'f9c hi\'d6n n
\'e9i \'ae\'dea ho\'b8.
